content.text:
The request succeeded with the `X-Retry-Pass: 1` header. From the response body:

```json
{
  "vessel_id": "mv-rotterdam-77",
  "positions": [
    {"ts": "2024-06-01T03:00:00Z", "lat": 51.9244, "lon": 4.4777, "sog_knots": 12.4},
    {"ts": "2024-06-01T03:10:00Z", "lat": 51.9301, "lon": 4.4512, "sog_knots": 11.8}
  ],
  "track_ref": "trk-9f3a-4410"
}
```

The track reference is `trk-9f3a-4410` and the top speed from the position history is **12.4 knots** (the maximum `sog_knots` across all positions).

```json
{"track_ref": "trk-9f3a-4410", "top_speed_knots": 12.4}
```
